<title>UK: One of nine May Flotta cargoes cancelled - trade.</title>
<headline>One of nine May Flotta cargoes cancelled - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of nine North Sea Flotta cargoes scheduled to load in May was cancelled on Friday, oil traders said.</p>
<p>The cancellation, for an end-May cargo, was for a 600,000 barrel loader owned by Enterprise Plc, the traders said.</p>
<p>The cancellation reduces the May Flotta programme to 4.85 million barrels from the originally planned 5.45 million barrels, down from 6.35 million expected to load in April.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
